      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present a superb home in the ever popular estate, 37 Beechdale Place. This property has been extended,refurbished, remodelled and finished to an excellent standard by it current owner. It will appeal to all first time buyers and also those wishing to trade down from a larger style property. the property also benefits from a highly energy efficient B rating.\n\nThe bright and spacious accommodation briefly comprises of a large extension to the rear, large living room, contemporary guest bathroom/utility and open plan kitchen / dining area. Upstairs there are 3 spacious and well proportioned bedrooms (master ensuite) and a large family bathroom. Outside to rear you will find a sunny orientation with an easy mainatained garden that boasts mature shrubbery and raised beds.\n\nBeechdale enjoys the best of both worlds, away from the hustle and bustle while still enjoying access to every conceivable amenity. Conveniently located within close proximity of a wide range of shopping centres, primary and secondary schools and the M50 network. The area is very well served by public transport with numerous bus routes running to the city centre.\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
